      "status": "stated",
      "value": "auto-regressive optimized transformer; SFT and RLHF for tuned versions",
      "source": {
        "quote": "Llama 2 is an auto-regressive language model that uses an optimized transformer architecture. The tuned versions use supervised fine-tuning (SFT) and reinforcement learning with human feedback (RLHF) to align with human preferences for helpfulness and safety.",
